      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Colour with OpenColorIO (needs the opencolorio package).\n\n1. PD OCIO Transform converts the sRGB image to scene-linear ACEScg; PD Save writes it as EXR.\n2. PD OCIO Display applies the ACES output transform for an sRGB monitor.\n3. PD OCIO Apply LUT is bypassed: set lut_path to a .cube/.3dl/.spi3d file, then un-bypass it (Ctrl+B).\n\nTry the built-in configs' Linear Rec.709 (sRGB) or Linear Rec.2020 spaces, or your studio config (config: custom file)."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Colour with OpenColorIO (needs the opencolorio package).\n\n1. PD OCIO Transform converts the sRGB image to scene-linear ACEScg; PD Save writes it as EXR.\n2. PD OCIO Display applies the ACES output transform for an sRGB monitor.\n3. PD OCIO Apply LUT is bypassed: set lut_path to a .cube/.3dl/.spi3d file, then un-bypass it (Ctrl+B).\n\nTry the built-in configs' Linear Rec.709 (sRGB) or Linear Rec.2020 spaces, or your studio config (config: custom file)."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
